<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="8ee1947">&lt;p&gt;
    Estimate total number of labor hours across each of the deliverable requirements including external labor estimates as
    well as FTE scenarios which would aid the decision making on the project. It&apos;s important to understand that work effort
    will evolve as the project progresses through the various project stages.&amp;nbsp; Follow this process:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Determine method of estimation required
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify the basic elements to complete the work product
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Determine the person hours needed to complete
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Add up all the person hours (or elapsed time) needed to finish all the tasks that constitute the project
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
